        "end": 926
      },
      "content": "**7. Repairs call handling: transfer to Kestrel Customer Hub (Paper 7).** Helen Strudwick presented the paper. The proposal is that from 1 September 2026 the repairs call handling team (nine posts) transfers to the Kestrel Customer Hub, which would take calls from 8am to 8pm on weekdays and 9am to 1pm on Saturdays.",
